flowchart TB
  accTitle: Deterministic controls around models and source-owned evidence
  accDescr: Triggers are hints. Code admits work under grants, holds and both budget scopes. Classical work makes no model call. Native model work uses a per-call boundary. Source owners record effects, consumption, settlement and later reuse independently.
